<title>HUNGARY: SOCCER-AUSTRALIA BEAT HUNGARY 3-1 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AUSTRALIA BEAT HUNGARY 3-1 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat Hungary 3-1 (halftime 1-1) in a friendly international on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Hungary: Klausz 33</p>
<p>Australia:  Aurelio Vidmar 6, 91, Muscat, 89</p>
<p>Attendance: 18,000</p>
